WEBVTT

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:13.950
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.290
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:23.090
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:28.210
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:39.130
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.900
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy,
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.730
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:33.500
Episode 4
Walking a Thorny Path

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:28.500
Don't forget this.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.500
In this school, my orders are absolute.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:33.510
All you need to do is follow my orders.

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:36.000
Follow them to the letter!

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:40.060
You're the dregs of society.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:41.850
But if you can be rehabilitated 
through training,

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:43.510
you can become productive members of society.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:44.950
Face right!

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:46.290
Let's warm up!

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.010
Run 1,500 meters!

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:49.900
Yes, sir!

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.520
Too slow! Pick up the pace!

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.740
Last place finisher gets one more lap!

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:06.990
Remain standing with proper 
posture for one hour.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.830
Nobody moves.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.990
Any movement will earn you 
a thirty-minute extension.

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.580
Okay, bunny hops for 500 meters!

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.650
I'd better not see any hands 
or knees hit the ground!

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:18.000
Last place finisher gets an extra 200 meters!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.050
Ten 100-meter dashes!

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.500
Swing those arms! Raise those feet!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.320
Last place finisher gets five more sprints!

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.010
Too slow! Run faster!

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.010
Ten sets of sixty sit-ups each!

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:31.030
Get those chins to those knees!

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:33.570
Ten sets of thirty push-ups each!

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:36.010
Asses down, backs straight!

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:38.020
Now, assume horse stance!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.020
Ten sets of three minutes each!

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:41.760
Legs bent to ninety degrees!

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:48.720
<i>What is all this?</i>

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.780
<i>Is this a phys ed school?</i>

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.000
I give up!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.170
I'm so hungry.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.510
My vision's blurring...

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:56.640
Same here...

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.280
Get up, trash!

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.800
Who told you to take a break?!

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.570
Instructor, I'm sorry!

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:10.570
I really can't stay standing!

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:15.070
That's all it takes to break you, is it?

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.200
Garbage! Quit your whining!

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.530
On your feet!

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:19.840
You want to be punished?

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:20.870
I'm so hungry!

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.770
I can barely move!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.320
On your feet!

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.640
I-Instructor!

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.630
Please don't hit them.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:36.500
They missed lunch, so they 
don't have any stamina.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:41.000
You just got here, but you 
think you're their leader, huh?

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.340
But they really—

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.010
Are you talking back to your instructor?

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:52.010
What is it?

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:53.680
You'd better not be skipping out.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:57.020
If I find one weed remaining, 
you'll be punished.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:05:00.140
You think you're in any 
position to look after others?

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:01.750
How much you've eaten doesn't matter!

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.340
When I tell you to stand, you stand!

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.010
When I tell you to run, you run!

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.340
I don't accept backtalk!

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.910
Don't you act big with me!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.700
Who the hell do you think you are?!

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:12.610
Stop it right now!

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:28.340
I... I didn't hit you on purpose.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:29.780
Please, don't hurt me.

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:31.020
It's not good to hurt people.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.180
You damned new kid...

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.530
You'll pay for hitting me.

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:37.140
You want to die, do you?

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.800
Then hit me until I die!

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.280
You're the one in the wrong!

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.420
What was that?

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.320
What the hell is he thinking?

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.530
You're the one who's in the wrong here.

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:59.500
So you can't just beat me into line!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:08.040
Don't think I'll give you the run of the 
place just because you're Shin's dog.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:11.010
Stuck-up brat. You think you're 
a real do-gooder, do you?

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.340
Shin's dog?

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:14.880
Don't be ridiculous.

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.530
Shin and I have nothing 
to do with each other.

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:19.170
This school is insane.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.920
There's nothing scientific 
about this training.

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:23.170
If you won't even feed them properly,

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.020
someone's going to die at some point!

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:27.820
Will you take responsibility if 
something really does happen?

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.100
There are laws about the
 treatment of minors, you know?

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.860
I'm not afraid of you instructors.

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:34.990
Because if you beat me, 
I'll report you to the police!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.740
This whole illegal school 
is gonna get shut down!

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:37.620
Police, huh?

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:39.080
Illegal, you say?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.430
You'll shut the school down, will you?

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.010
Has Internet usage made you crazy, too?

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:47.920
At this school, I am the 
police! I am the law!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.290
Now, shout away!

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:52.010
Who will come to save you?

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:54.000
You're the one who's crazy!

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:57.180
No matter how much you hit me, 
I won't submit to you!

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:01.520
I can't wait to see where this goes.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.370
The rest of you, say something!

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.920
You're sick of it, aren't you?

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.810
The way this school does things is illegal!

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:09.080
Don't be afraid!

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.990
All of you, say something!

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.910
I'm trash! I'm garbage!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.400
I'll follow your instructions, instructor!

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:18.050
I follow the rules of the school!

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:20.170
Your instructions are absolute!

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:22.000
I'll follow your orders!

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.300
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.840
You hear that?

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.320
Looks like nobody's taking your side.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:33.010
And if that's not enough, 
I'll ask one more time.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:36.020
Does anyone think what I'm doing is illegal?

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:38.740
N-No! It's not!

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:43.520
Like you said, useless trash 
like us should be punished!

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:46.130
What's wrong with you guys?

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.520
Remember this.

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:52.020
At this school, I make the rules!

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.990
Now, acknowledge your mistake!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:57.510
Or do you still have more you 
want to say, you arrogant trash?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.120
I...

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:01.860
Head Instructor.

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:06.010
I have something to say.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.000
Sh-Shiori...

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.640
I knew it. Someone came to help me!

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.520
Instructor. Forgive me.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:32.500
As student council president,

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:35.000
I take responsibility for the 
insubordination of new arrivals.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:37.170
Please give him once more chance.

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:40.280
I'll see that it doesn't happen again.

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:41.590
Please.

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:44.080
Shiori...

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.860
What are you saying? Why?

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:06.580
Shiori... why?

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:08.890
Are you stupid or something?

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.160
You think you can become a hero here?

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:13.410
The instructors here are serious brutes.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:16.580
Most of them are retired military or ex-cops.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.720
You couldn't beat them if 
there were twenty of you.

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:20.850
If you don't want to die, apologize.

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:23.900
I don't care if I die. I'm not afraid!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:28.160
If I have to live in a place 
like this, I'd rather die!

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.540
Good is good and evil is evil!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.850
I'm not in the wrong! I'll never accept it!

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:34.800
It's the school that's illegal.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.260
The teachers are using corporal 
punishment on the students!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.610
What will you do if somebody dies here?

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:48.020
Don't be crazy! They really will kill you!

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.310
Do you know how many have died here?

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:52.580
I don't care! I'm not in the wrong!

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.100
Idiot! Get a grip already!

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:57.100
Nothing to see here! 
Get back to your training!

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:56.690
What will dying accomplish for you?

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:57.770
Let me go!

00:09:57.770 --> 00:09:58.890
Leave me alone!

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:00.950
I'm putting an end to this hellhole!

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:00.940
Stop it!

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:03.710
Come on! Try and hit me if you want!

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:05.080
I'd love to see you try!

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:06.480
Hibiki! You have to stop!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.630
Back off! Don't get in my way!

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:16.930
Oh, no...

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.090
Hey! What are you doing?

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:28.890
You bastard! Stay down!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.230
I gave you a chance, you know.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.780
What do they call this again?

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:36.300
"What goes around comes around"?

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.990
I had my eye on you for a while, 
but the truth finally comes out.

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:51.420
So our proud student council president 
was sneaking around with a cell phone.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.080
You'll need to be punished 
for breaking the rules.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.420
Wudo, you...

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:57.430
Shiori.

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.770
I'm disappointed in you.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:03.620
You said I employed corporal 
punishment earlier.

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:05.440
You said the school was illegal.

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:10.020
Fine. It's time you learned some sense.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:12.010
All of you!

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:14.940
If your classmate does something wrong, 
you'll receive the punishment for him!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:15.780
Isn't that right?

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:16.970
Yes! Yes, sir!

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:18.580
We'll gladly take it!

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:20.910
If my classmate is wrong, 
it's my responsibility!

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:22.540
What the hell?

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.860
Then get down on the ground!

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:28.590
Until he repents, you're all 
taking his punishment!

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.020
Thank you! Thank you, instructor!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.320
Thank you!

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.920
This isn't their fault! Stop it!

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:47.380
Bring Shiori to her feet.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:53.150
Bring the girls from Shiori's class,
 class nineteen, here.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:56.060
Line up in front of her 
and teach her a lesson.

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:58.900
If you think Shiori was wrong, 
slap her across the face.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.780
Make her realize what she's done wrong.

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:08.290
You broke the rules.
 I think you were wrong.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:10.570
Put your back into it!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:12.900
If you don't, you'll get punished, too!

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:15.500
Shiori... I'm sorry!

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:18.150
I'm sorry!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:20.930
Thank you!

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:24.720
I can't hear you! Louder!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.420
Thank you for your guidance!

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.420
Stop it!

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:32.600
Stop hitting them! Please!

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:34.520
Stop!

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.500
Instructor! Thank you!

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.520
Thank you for your guidance!

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:45.080
I was wrong! You were right!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.090
Please forgive me!

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:48.090
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:50.210
I've apologized enough now, haven't I?

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:51.560
Please stop!

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:54.410
I'm begging you, stop it now!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:59.040
All right. That's it for now.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:00.200
Disperse!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:03.250
Damn it, my back's in agony.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:05.660
If you wanna die right after you get here,

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:07.420
don't drag us down with you!

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:12.210
If you want to die, 
just kill yourself, asshole!

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:18.820
Now, disperse! 
Return to the classrooms at once!

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:20.400
This isn't over.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:26.150
Now, my slap comes last!

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.440
How are you feeling, dear President?

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:33.440
After what you did,

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:36.200
you know you can't be president anymore.

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.230
Well?

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:40.330
If you want to keep it up, 
maybe you should lick my shoes.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:46.450
You, too! Get inside now!

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:00.580
I'm sorry, Shiori.

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:02.840
I did this to you...

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:06.010
I'm so, so sorry.

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:11.210
You're worthless.

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:13.920
Never talk to me again.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.780
I... What am I doing?

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:22.440
Acting like I'm some great do-gooder...

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.840
Damn it!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.140
How could this happen?

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:32.730
Spoken like a true loser.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.370
It suits you.

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:39.700
What do you think?

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:42.810
Did it feel good trying to defend them?

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:45.700
You even outed Shiori for her cell phone.

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.750
Quite the hero.

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:52.740
I want to be your dog!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:54.810
Make me your dog!

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:57.900
I'll do anything to stop being a loser!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:00.250
You can do something, can't you?

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:04.800
A good horse won't eat trampled grass.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.020
In other words, I don't look back.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:10.000
If I let you come and go as you please,

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:12.000
it would ruin my reputation.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.590
But I...

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:17.220
I don't let just anyone become my dog.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:21.300
You had a chance, and you let it go.

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:24.790
If you want me to reconsider, 
I'll do so on three conditions.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.220
Three... conditions?

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:31.240
One... Become leader of your class.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.310
Two...

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:36.300
Oust Wudo from his position 
as discipline officer.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.300
But...

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:38.040
Three...

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:50.760
If you can meet all three conditions,

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.910
I'll acknowledge you as my dog.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:57.520
With my help, you can rule this school.

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:01.480
Who are you? What do you want?

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:03.980
You want to know?

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.190
Then do what I told you.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:14.080
Things got a bit noisy out on the field.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.720
What happened?

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:17.480
Nothing in particular.

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.600
I hope that's true...

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:23.500
But you know, it is our job to turn that trash

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:25.710
into what their parents want them to be.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:29.000
It's about time.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.260
Head to the workshop.

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.810
Instructor Ryo is waiting.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:33.500
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:42.600
Your room's full of weirdos.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.730
The coward from before ran, too.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.690
Your fighting strength is only level five, 
so you're a burden for our class.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:51.750
And on top of that, your new
 roommate got us all punished!

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:53.700
You hear us?

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.450
You'd better see to it!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.880
Give him a real beating!

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:58.620
Beat him to death!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:01.730
If you don't send him to the hospital, 
you'll be sending <i>yourselves</i> to the hospital!

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.490
That goes for you new kids, too. Got it?

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:11.080
What the hell? You really came back?

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.340
You've got some guts.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.690
We were just hoping to see you.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:14.820
Listen to me, all of you!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:17.510
Starting today, I'm class four's leader!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:24.980
This guy's a total moron!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.220
What did he say?

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:28.010
I'm laughing so hard my stomach hurts!

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:29.010
What was he thinking?

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:32.990
If you make me your leader, you can 
eat this stuff whenever you want.

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:34.810
Ham?

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.070
Pig's feet?

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.470
Chicken wings and sausage...

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:39.800
Bread and chocolate, too!

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.000
What the heck?

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.360
What do you think?

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:46.010
Want to take me as your leader?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:49.210
We'll follow you forever, leader! Thank you!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.860
Leader! Hibiki-sama!

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:51.960
I'm so glad you're alive!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:53.560
Leader, what can we do for you?

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.560
Leader, we pledge our loyalty to you!

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:56.720
Okay, gather everyone 
from class four together.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.970
We've got some big game to hunt.

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:01.920
Becoming class leader is 
merely the first step.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.690
The important part is what comes after.

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:12.210
Today was so great.

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:14.980
Yeah! I hope Shiori gets a huge punishment!

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:14.980
I can't wait to get my hands on her!

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:17.160
She's got such a hot body!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:24.990
Your position won't be stable
unless you defeat the real leader.

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:29.490
Wudo is the target that you must defeat.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:39.400
Hey, Wudo! You damned pig!

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.790
This school is mine from now on!

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:43.480
You don't like it, fight me!

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.980
Damn you...

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:47.930
Hold it! You want to die, huh?

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.850
Call the guys from class one! 
He's starting a fight!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:51.980
We'll finish you!

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:02.280
Damn you... Come back here!

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:04.490
<i>Oust Wudo from his position 
as discipline officer.</i>

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.310
<i>And take that position for yourself.</i>

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.770
Damn him. Why isn't he slowing down?

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:23.720
Damn it! Someone grab him!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.220
Whoever grabs him gets anything they want!

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.720
I'll be the one to get him!

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:29.650
No, me!

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:30.890
I'll get him first!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:32.950
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:36.110
<i>Just a little long-distance running, 
and no one can catch me.</i>

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:37.870
Me? Beat Wudo?

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.110
You gotta be kidding.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:41.840
If I could beat that guy, 
I wouldn't need your help!

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.730
Besides, he's always 
surrounded by his own men...

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:46.260
You idiot.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:50.000
Humans can kill beasts far 
more powerful than themselves.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.120
And their fellow humans, of course.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.280
With proper application of 
wisdom and strength,

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:56.200
you can defeat any enemy.

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:59.890
And you're not without 
your strengths, are you?

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:23.480
What?

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:27.490
You put bricks... in your jacket...?

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:34.480
<i>You must have at least one skill, don't you?</i>

00:20:36.890 --> 00:20:38.740
It really is a shame.

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:41.010
I had such high hopes for you.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.250
Why do you want to quit?

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:45.110
If you keep going at your current pace,

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.490
you could even win the next tournament.

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:48.460
I'm sorry.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.700
I've made up my mind.

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:52.570
Is it the pressure?

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:54.480
If there's something on your 
mind, you can talk to me.

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:56.500
I'm sorry.

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:01.320
<i>Use your strengths to 
exploit their weaknesses.</i>

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.820
<i>If you can do that,</i>

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:05.980
<i>you'll be a loser no longer.</i>

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.500
Damn. He's incredible.

00:21:15.780 --> 00:21:19.000
He can run that far, and still hit people...

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.940
How much stamina has he got?

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:33.980
That son of a...

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:35.760
Circle around to the other end.

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:37.410
We'll trap him.

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:42.180
This is a dead end!

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:43.700
I got you!

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:48.250
What the hell?

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:49.990
He's as slippery as a fish!

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.450 --> 00:23:27.960
Go! Quick!

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:29.190
Don't let him get away!

00:23:29.190 --> 00:23:33.380
This is the only way to 
see the right thing done.

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:31.680
I can handle him by myself.

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:33.680
I'll beat you black and blue!

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:39.690
I'm going to take revenge on 
everyone who's bullied me.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.930
Episode 5
Their Parting of the Ways
